\"Remove the rug at the hallway door or fix its edge flat to the floor, away from the walking path.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口的地毯移走，或將邊緣固定貼平，遠離走道。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_92a47e31-d181-4091-b4e0-08f5f2ed2402","call_id":"call_92a47e31-d181-4091-b4e0-08f5f2ed2402","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H3\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the cable from the hallway door walking path and route it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口走道上的電線移開，沿牆邊收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_4781dd21-79ed-4962-b195-4e3734a3fda5","call_id":"call_4781dd21-79ed-4962-b195-4e3734a3fda5","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H4\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the second cable from the hallway door walking path and secure it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口走道上的另一條電線移開，沿牆邊固定。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_e322b42a-ea11-4029-a226-c3b099b23d08","call_id":"call_e322b42a-ea11-4029-a226-c3b099b23d08","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H5\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the cable from the hallway to bathroom walking path and route it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的電線移開，沿牆邊收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_23963981-dea4-4a1f-b24f-c29cf63728e2","call_id":"call_23963981-dea4-4a1f-b24f-c29cf63728e2","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H6\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the shoes from the hallway to bathroom walking path into a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的鞋子收到鞋櫃。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_77d63fbc-f9ca-4b48-bf3f-a4bfbbe19604","call_id":"call_77d63fbc-f9ca-4b48-bf3f-a4bfbbe19604","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H7\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the second pair of shoes from the hallway to bathroom walking path into a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的另一雙鞋收到鞋櫃。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_021e4e1a-6c27-4951-b4ac-abd3e56fbe69","call_id":"call_021e4e1a-6c27-4951-b4ac-abd3e56fbe69","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H8\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the blue slip-on slippers from the hallway to bathroom walking path to storage.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的藍色室內拖鞋收到置物處。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_7c65381e-6630-4334-9ba3-67765cca2671","call_id":"call_7c65381e-6630-4334-9ba3-67765cca2671","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H9\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the blue slide slippers from the hallway to bathroom walking path to storage.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的藍色拖鞋收到置物處。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_0455fa1a-5648-4359-9fde-73d8876a43c0","call_id":"call_0455fa1a-5648-4359-9fde-73d8876a43c0","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H10\",\"instruction_en\":\"Dry the standing water by the toilet base and apply anti-slip treatment to the bathroom floor.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將浴室馬桶旁的積水擦乾，並在浴室地板做防滑處理。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"FA35\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_6618fe91-5f16-4359-94a8-84abe54491ec","call_id":"call_6618fe91-5f16-4359-94a8-84abe54491ec","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H11\",\"instruction_en\":\"Install a fixed grab bar near the toilet in the bathroom.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"在浴室馬桶旁加裝固定式扶手。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"FA22\"}","status":"completed"}]